Origin within tsacor
------------------
tsacor inherits the engine (and the documentation of its reverse engineering,
inst/REVERSE_ENGINEERING_RTSA.md) unchanged from tsahr 0.2.8.17. Version
numbers such as "0.2.7.13" in code comments and in that document refer to the
development history of tsahr.
